---
description: Rules for editing portfolio content
globs: src/content/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

- Facts must match Carlos's Master CV: employers, titles, dates, metrics and
  technologies. Do not add or embellish.
- Missing detail: leave `// TODO(carlos): ...` instead of guessing.
- Keep `satisfies <Type>` on every export so TypeScript validates the shape.
- After edits run `pnpm test` (content integrity tests).
- For new case studies follow the `add-case-study` skill.
